1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,128
Oh no! Four little stars have disappeared!

2
00:00:03,118 --> 00:00:05,377
Lumi needs your help to bring them home.

3
00:00:05,367 --> 00:00:08,059
Let's find the first one, up here, on this side.

4
00:00:08,049 --> 00:00:11,241
Brush the outside, the inside, and the tops of your teeth.

5
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:32,189
One star is back!

6
00:00:32,179 --> 00:00:33,887
Look at that sparkling trail!

7
00:00:33,877 --> 00:00:38,489
I think it's showing us where the next star is hiding. Top teeth, on the other side!

8
00:01:00,750 --> 00:01:02,105
Two stars found!

9
00:01:02,096 --> 00:01:06,312
The moon has a secret... the third star is hiding just below us.

10
00:01:06,302 --> 00:01:08,285
Let's go! Bottom teeth now!

11
00:01:30,750 --> 00:01:32,158
Just one more star!

12
00:01:32,148 --> 00:01:33,798
Can you see where it belongs?

13
00:01:33,788 --> 00:01:38,124
Let's make the whole sky sparkle again. Bottom teeth, on the other side!
